<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="description" content="Participant sign in for CareCycle donors and NGO members."><title>Participant sign in | CareCycle</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/defaultEntry.css"><script src="/accessibility.js" defer></script></head><body class="auth-page"><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><main class="auth-shell" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="auth-story" aria-labelledby="carecycle-title"><a class="brand brand-light" href="/home" aria-label="CareCycle home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">C</span><span>CareCycle</span></a><div class="story-content"><span class="eyebrow">Donors and NGO members</span><h1 id="carecycle-title">List or request medical equipment.</h1><p>Donors create listings and review requests. Verified NGOs browse equipment and submit requests.</p><div class="impact-strip"><div><strong>Donor</strong><span>List and track equipment</span></div><div><strong>NGO</strong><span>Find and request equipment</span></div><div><strong>Requests</strong><span>Arrange pickup and acknowledge receipt</span></div></div></div><p class="story-note">Verification reviews organizations, not equipment condition or medical fitness.</p></section><section class="auth-panel"><div class="auth-card"><nav class="portal-switch" aria-label="Choose sign-in portal"><a class="active" href="/login" aria-current="page">Participant login</a><a href="/admin/login">CareCycle admin</a></nav><div class="mobile-brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">C</span><span>CareCycle</span></div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Participant access</span><h2>Donor or NGO sign in</h2><p class="auth-subtitle">Sign in to open your donor or NGO dashboard.</p><% if (message) { %><div class="auth-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"><%= message %></div><% } %><form action="/login" method="post" class="auth-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required><label for="password">Password</label><input id="password" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required><button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Sign in as participant</button></form><p class="auth-switch">No participant account? <a href="/register">Create a donor or NGO account</a></p><p class="auth-switch"><a href="/home">How CareCycle works</a></p></div></section></main></body></html>
